 ### Quality-Scaled Chunk Streaming
-Quality-Scaled Chunk Streaming streams chunks around the camera using a ring-nearest strategy. It applies a quality-scaled view radius, throttles worldgen and meshing by budget, and unloads far chunks while preserving edited data. Typical view radius is 2–5 chunks per preset, with 1–4 workers and a quality-scaled mesh budget [S6, unofficial].
